  "body": "There's something special about a classic Kiwi weatherboard home, especially one that brings together relaxed coastal living, sunny outdoor spaces and room for the whole family to enjoy. Set in the highly desirable Red Beach area, 6 Red Beach Road offers a wonderful balance of comfort, character and practicality, with space to make it your own.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 467sqm freehold site, this fully fenced and gated property offers a private, sun-filled backyard with plenty of room for children and pets to play. Two separate decks provide options for enjoying the sunshine throughout the day, from peaceful mornings with a coffee to afternoon drinks and summer evenings entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nInside, the open-plan kitchen, living and dining area has been re-energised into a bright, modern and functional space that makes everyday living feel effortless. Stone benchtops, gas cooking and generous storage bring together style and practicality, while the natural connection between the kitchen, dining and living areas makes entertaining a breeze. With three generous bedrooms, a bathroom and a separate toilet, there's plenty of room to settle in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nComfort is taken care of year-round with two heat pumps and a ducted HRV ventilation system throughout the home, helping create a comfortable and fresh environment in every season.\r\n\r\nThere's also a handy bonus downstairs, with a full-head-height space offering plenty of flexibility. Whether you need somewhere to store bikes, surfboards and fishing gear, a spot for extra family essentials, or even want to create your own man cave, it's a useful addition that offers possibilities beyond the main living areas.\r\n\r\nWhat's To Love:\r\n- Classic Kiwi weatherboard home with timeless appeal\r\n- Three generous bedrooms, one bathroom and a separate toilet\r\n- Modernised open-plan kitchen, living and dining\r\n- Stone benchtops, gas cooking and generous kitchen storage\r\n- Two heat pumps and a ducted HRV ventilation system\r\n- Generous 467sqm freehold site\r\n- Fully fenced and gated backyard\r\n- Full-head-height downstairs space for storage, hobbies or a potential man cave\r\n- Ample off-street parking, with room for cars and a boat\r\n- Within walking distance of local schools, shops and the beach\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the community - one of Red Beach's greatest assets. The Hibiscus Coast is renowned for its relaxed seaside atmosphere, welcoming neighbourhoods and genuine sense of belonging. From morning beach walks and afternoons spent outdoors to local sporting activities and catching up with neighbours, there's a wonderful connection here that makes this area so appealing. It's a place where families can put down roots, friendships flourish and the coastal lifestyle becomes part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, a growing family or someone looking to embrace a more relaxed way of living, 6 Red Beach Road offers an exciting opportunity to enjoy the best of coastal living, with practical spaces, sunny outdoor areas and room to make it your own.\r\n\r\nCome along, experience the charm for yourself and discover the lifestyle waiting for you at 6 Red Beach Road.\r\n\r\nAuction: 4:00pm, Thursday 19 November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here: https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
